Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.48,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}明星之路一步登天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:24.64,ED - CN - Vertical,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1840,540)}其标准也不会无故提高
